  "descriptionParagraphs": [
    "On Maafushi Island, a sunny beach getaway surrounded by coconut palm trees, the 3-star Kaani Beach Hotel is located. On-site activities include scuba diving, island picnics, dolphin viewing, and snorkeling. Kaani Beach Hotel is the ideal choice for anyone looking for a romantic getaway or something a little more laid-back.",
    "Sea View rooms with private balconies are available at Kaani Beach Hotel, a sunny beach getaway surrounded by coconut palm trees. All of the rooms have air conditioning, a hot water shower, satellite television, wireless Internet, a mini bar, a hair dryer, and a safe. There is also a restaurant offering buffet breakfast and dinner, as well as a rooftop open-air terrace with loungers."
